Universal ImageGen Agent
Copyright 2026 SnowSky1

This project is an independently adapted derivative of the OpenAI Codex
"imagegen" skill. The unmodified source snapshot used for the adaptation is
preserved under upstream/imagegen/.

The adaptation was made on September 24, 2026. Major changes include:
- replacing Codex-only built-in-tool assumptions with a runtime-neutral CLI;
- adding provider, model, base URL, header, and credential configuration;
- adding a reusable Python library interface and machine-readable output;
- adding tests, packaging, security guidance, and agent integration docs;
- updating the default model used by new configurations while keeping it
  fully overridable.

